#: ../../chapter04.rst:3
msgid "Web Portal"
msgstr "Webportal"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:5
msgid ""
"Click the Portal – \"My Files\" Link for the default Cluster Admin to "
"view his files/folders over the web portal:"
msgstr "Klik på Portalen – \"Mine Filer\"-linket for standard Cluster Admin for at se hans filer/mapper over webportalen:"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:9
msgid "See below image for the files and folder view:"
msgstr "Se nedenstående billede for visning af filer og mapper:"

#: ../../chapter04.rst:13
msgid ""
"From here you can test the installation by creating files, migrating, "
"editing, sharing and deleting files to verify the storage setup is "
"working as expected."
msgstr "Herfra kan du teste installationen ved at oprette filer, migrere, redigere, dele og slette filer for at verificere, at lageropsætningen fungerer som forventet."

